rent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a079ebca0d3f"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1535774855, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1586110421, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "matching.match()", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "matching.match()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "3f343411e5ce4b2caf6b", "type": "text", "x": 1790, "y": 37.5, "width": 347.62, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a079ebca0d3f"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 990863338, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1406410609, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Pair every STEP part with a BOM row", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Pair every STEP part with a BOM row", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "a86dd98f62e04f3aa232", "type": "text", "x": 1790, "y": 70.5, "width": 411.98625000000004, "height": 168.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a079ebca0d3f"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1138930234, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 536659962, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "For each STEP part, in this order:\n1 its name equals a BOM part number -> matched\n2 else remove a CAD copy-suffix (-1, <1>, :1, _1); if the rest\nequals a part number -> matched\n3 else its name equals exactly one BOM description ->\nmatched\n4 else -> unmatched\n\nNothing else. No fuzzy matching, no 'closest name'.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "For each STEP part, in this order:\n1 its name equals a BOM part number -> matched\n2 else remove a CAD copy-suffix (-1, <1>, :1, _1); if the rest\nequals a part number -> matched\n3 else its name equals exactly one BOM description ->\nmatched\n4 else -> unmatched\n\nNothing else. No fuzzy matching, no 'closest name'.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "8648f8be7d5c4ec1b801", "type": "arrow", "x": 1684, "y": 87.5, "width": 90, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1052296890, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 599367491, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [45.0, 0], [45.0, 122.5], [90, 122.5]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "88ca8d9a5a0d44b18338", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "b3d27a57b6d44d7497d0", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "elbowed": false}, {"id": "21c53181a5f445e9b2a7", "type": "arrow", "x": 1684, "y": 332.5, "width": 90, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1986061746, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1069587376, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [45.0, 0], [45.0, -122.5], [90, -122.5]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBi