he STEP\n- a quantity that differs (BOM says 2, STEP has 1)\n\nA pop-up lists exactly which part and why. You fix the file and\nupload again. The app never carries on 'hoping it is fine'.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "- a STEP part with no BOM row\n- a BOM part that is not in the STEP\n- a quantity that differs (BOM says 2, STEP has 1)\n\nA pop-up lists exactly which part and why. You fix the file and\nupload again. The app never carries on 'hoping it is fine'.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "bfe8c3965b004be6b052", "type": "arrow", "x": 2009.0, "y": 420, "width": 0, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1895907919, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 976436736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 60]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "b3d27a57b6d44d7497d0", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "3c217017a8674df2a828", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "elbowed": false}, {"id": "a7464ba092dc4580a6cf", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2334, "y": 0, "width": 470, "height": 420, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["651ddd72a864"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1932092302, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1939557090, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "d6bdfa99791c4c00bc5d", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "94bf3398da004461a3d8", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "6d07f17742bb4825b2d5", "type": "text", "x": 2350, "y": 16, "width": 147.56, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["651ddd72a864"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 990016091, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 753283161, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "builder.analyze()", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "builder.analyze()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "444b601365b342d8b35f", "type": "text", "x": 2350, "y": 37.5, "width": 153.79, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["651ddd72a864"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1219137346, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1558826598, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Build the part list", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Build the part list", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "85ca3cb4917644cb9afc", "type": "text", "x": 2350, "y": 70.5, "width": 421.96375, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["651ddd72a864"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1976394565, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1197400050, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One line per part number, with:\n- description and material from the BOM\n- section = the nearest assembly above it in the STEP tree\n- copies = how many times it appears\n- suggested type + the reason (word found)\n- radius: a round part has two equal sides and one different\nside; radius = half of an equal side, measured from the STEP\nfile", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "One line per part number, with:\n- description and material from the BOM\n- section = the nearest assembly above it in the STEP tree\n- copies = how many times it appears\n- suggested type + the reason (word found)\n- radius: a round part has two equal sides and one different\nside; radius = half of an equal side, measured from the STEP\nfile", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "d6bdfa99791c4c00bc5d", "type": "arrow", "x": 2244, "y": 210.0, "width": 90, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1554290579, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 980436053, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [90, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "b3d27a57b6d44d7497d0", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "a7464ba092dc4580a6cf", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "elbowed": false}, {"id": "4c25fd49905e404a9bae", "type": "text", "x": 2249.764375, "y": 184.0, "width": 78.47125, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1044983919, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1414945418, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "clean match", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "clean match", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "5cad13b29d8f4a9a930e", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2334, "y": 480, "width": 470, "height": 193.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3530811218af"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 476335517, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2019915641, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "94bf3398da004461a3d8", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4af8656b8d6e490f93aa", "type": "text", "x": 2350, "y": 496, "width": 228.995, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3530811218af"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 697217585, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1749519834, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Then: three screens for you", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 16, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Then: three screens for you", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "b0556df72251440f86fe", "type": "text", "x": 2350, "y": 526.5, "width": 433.64750000000004, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3530811218af"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1502318642, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1793205544, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 confirm each part's type\n2 confirm what drives what\n3 type the numbers (motor nameplate, friction, three levels per\npart, sensor tolerance)\n\nBuild stays locked until all three are complete. Next page: what\nBuild does with the answers.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 confirm each part's type\n2 confirm what drives what\n3 type the numbers (motor nameplate, friction, three levels per\npart, sensor tolerance)\n\nBuild stays locked until all three are complete. Next page: what\nBuild does with the answers.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "94bf3398da004461a3d8", "type": "arrow", "x": 2569.0, "y": 420, "width": 0, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 356631933, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1882690702, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 60]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "a7464ba092dc4580a6cf", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "5cad13b29d8f4a9a930e", "focus": 0, "gap": 1}, "elbowed": false}, {"id": "a484c162b38f438d981d", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 737.75, "width": 913.88, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1949787364, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1323593125, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "How the suggestions are made (the app suggests, you always confirm)", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 19, "containerId": null, "originalText": "How the suggestions are made (the app suggests, you always confirm)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "b29a7ff5bffc408591bd", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 783.75, "width": 520, "height": 197.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4205c16cb3d9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 575820924, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1659970615, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "74c39262fbee46bea49e", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 799.75, "width": 217.0, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4205c16cb3d9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1957168997, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1030289966, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "one line of the part list", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "one line of the part list", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "888f0f72653a4ca1a8f4", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 821.25, "width": 211.94875000000002, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4205c16cb3d9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 664781756, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 651324790, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Example: part MS00203", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Example: part MS00203", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "ffbfac68662c4cd9a0f4", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 853.0, "width": 487.58125, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4205c16cb3d9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2055918610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1716395375, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "STEP name MS00203 equals BOM part number MS00203 -> matched\nBOM description: Rotary Disk, 180mm\nSection: Disk Section\nWord 'disk' found -> suggests 'Rotating disk'\nSize box has two equal sides of 179.9 mm -> round, radius 89.96 mm\n(measured, not typed)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "STEP name MS00203 equals BOM part number MS00203 -> matched\nBOM description: Rotary Disk, 180mm\nSection: Disk Section\nWord 'disk' found -> suggests 'Rotating disk'\nSize box has two equal sides of 179.9 mm -> round, radius 89.96 mm\n(measured, not typed)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "08ae9858f54f4529aa20", "type": "rectangle", "x": 580, "y": 783.75, "width": 640, "height": 272.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["50b6249eb3b6"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1516565419, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1784704597, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "c914c1ffd58e45e78343", "type": "text", "x": 596, "y": 799.75, "width": 217.0, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["50b6249eb3b6"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1082866084, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1207291046, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "part_types.suggest_type()", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "part_types.suggest_type()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "0c4e51589c56418ab0c0", "type": "text", "x": 596, "y": 821.25, "width": 427.16375, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["50b6249eb3b6"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1111854844, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1089540208, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Suggesting a part type (first matching word wins)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Suggesting a part type (first matching word wins)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "d859927f5e9040609f0d", "type": "text", "x": 596, "y": 853.0, "width": 379.48625000000004, "height": 187.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["50b6249eb3b6"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1398901775, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1322438075, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "'brushless' or 'bldc' -> Brushless gearmotor\n'motor' -> DC gearmotor\n'idler' -> Idler pulley\n'drive pulley' or 'pulley' -> Drive pulley\n'belt' -> Belt\n'shaft' -> Shaft\n'disk' or 'disc' -> Rotating disk\n'flipper' or 'paddle' -> Flipper arm\n'bracket', 'plate', 'frame' -> Fixed part\nno known word -> the app leaves it blank and asks you", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "'brushless' or 'bldc' -> Brushless gearmotor\n'motor' -> DC gearmotor\n'idler' -> Idler pulley\n'drive pulley' or 'pulley' -> Drive pulley\n'belt' -> Belt\n'shaft' -> Shaft\n'disk' or 'disc' -> Rotating disk\n'flipper' or 'paddle' -> Flipper arm\n'bracket', 'plate', 'frame' -> Fixed part\nno known word -> the app leaves it blank and asks you", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "67830559bf6846f9ac1c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1280, "y": 783.75, "width": 760, "height": 235.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["51f0aa17f245"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1262601660, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 873318317, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a94fcf5ce2c94fda8a55", "type": "text", "x": 1296, "y": 799.75, "width": 147.56, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["51f0aa17f245"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 669680592, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1569659959, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "linking.COUPLINGS", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "linking.COUPLINGS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "40b5e2203cff451bb81f", "type": "text", "x": 1296, "y": 821.25, "width": 508.495, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["51f0aa17f245"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 446286779, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1049918619, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Suggesting what drives what, and how the load passes up", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Suggesting what drives what, and how the load passes up", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "604ecb178f204967aa3d", "type": "text", "x": 1296, "y": 853.0, "width": 537.8100000000001, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["51f0aa17f245"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1099278974, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 787263732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "shaft -> motor: same shaft, torque passes unchanged\ndrive pulley -> motor: same shaft, torque passes unchanged\nrotating disk -> shaft: same shaft, torque passes unchanged\nbelt -> drive pulley: belt force x pulley radius = torque\nidler pulley -> belt: torque / pulley radius = belt force\nflipper arm -> belt: force passes unchanged\n\nIf only one candidate parent exists the app proposes it; if several, you choose.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "shaft -> motor: same shaft, torque passes unchanged\ndrive pulley -> motor: same shaft, torque passes unchanged\nrotating disk -> shaft: same shaft, torque passes unchanged\nbelt -> drive pulley: belt force x pulley radius = torque\nidler pulley -> belt: torque / pulley radius = belt force\nflipper arm -> belt: force passes unchanged\n\nIf only one candidate parent exists the app proposes it; if several, you choose.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "8ef0e38d488d481ba76b", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 1126.5, "width": 88.66, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2006081202, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469376651, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "COLOUR KEY", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "COLOUR KEY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "003d146cba2c41dea72d", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 1150.5, "width": 22, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#3b5bdb", "backgroundColor": "#dbe4ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1338451569, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1894229933, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "197b75b6bff04f63b0dd", "type": "text", "x": 32, "y": 1152.5, "width": 74.92875000000001, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 161867370, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1684228149, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Client's file", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Client's file", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}